  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till handl&#xe4;ggning av energiportf&#xf6;lj</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support in managing energy portfolio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Ambassaden i Chisinau har sedan juni 2014 haft en vakans p&#xe5; tj&#xe4;nsten som energihandl&#xe4;ggare. F&#xf6;r att kunna hantera energiportf&#xf6;ljen tills en ers&#xe4;ttare finns p&#xe5; plats s&#xe5; har ambassaden behov av st&#xf6;d av en konsult. Uppdraget kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras p&#xe5; deltidsbasis av ungef&#xe4;r tv&#xe5; veckor per m&#xe5;nad under perioden februari-april 2015. Ett f&#xf6;rsta kontrakt kommer att tecknas f&#xf6;r en period av 40 arbetsdagar, varav 20 arbetsdagar i Moldavien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy in Chisinau has had a vacancy for the position as programme officer for the energy portfolio since June 2014. To be able to manage the energy portfolio until a replacement will arrive in Chisinau, the Embassy will engage a consultant that temporarily will manage the portfolio. The assignment will be implemented on a part-time basis of approximately two weeks per month for the period February - April 2015.  A first contract will be signed for a period of 40 working days, out of which 20 working days in Chisinau..</narrative>
  </description>
